  "operator_note": "Gentle PI+feedforward for 0.5. Starts near 0.58 then eases to ~0.30. Filtered to ignore single dips; brief low readings are sensor, not temperature. Keeps well below 0.85/0.9. No tuning needed.",
  "predicted_behavior": "From ambient ~0.18 to 0.5: rise at ~0.0035/s, enters 0.475-0.525 in ~180-250s, settled by 300s. True overshoot <0.015, no oscillation. Steady u ~0.29-0.31 (0.296 nominal). After settling, true stays within +-0.01, noisy y mostly in band except rejected dips. Energy near minimum: steady u^2 ~0.09.",
